1
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:11,311
Long ago, ten suns climbed the sky at once.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:18,076
The rivers boiled. The fields cracked. The whole earth began to burn.

3
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,900
Then came Hou Yi, the archer.

4
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,179
One arrow for every burning sun.

5
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:43,120
But the last one, he spared. So the world would have light, and not fire.

6
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,450
One light is enough. Even now, every shadow play burns just one.
